ghting each other.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","And whose fault is that? Being around you, I feel like I'm picking up bad habits.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Though ...==W== it doesn't feel too bad right now.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","020","music",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","attention",null,-0.25,1.3,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Also...==W== About today...",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"zuochupeng","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I know. A secret just between us, right?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","021",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Thank you.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","phylanis_bathing",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuad",0.75,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["show","avg1_162","c","002",0.55,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","c",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.8],["mrt",1,"z","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","This is ...==W== the Olympia Bathhouse? Alina, why are we here?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,"jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m147"],["ctl","avg1_162","c","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","We're hiding. I asked Lulu to arrange a private bath for us, one normally meant just for nobles.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","c","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","If Caligula's men realize they caught the wrong people, they'd never suspect the real culprits to be taking a relaxing bath.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","c","006","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_162","Besides, we just ran all over those caves, and we're covered in dust. It's the perfect time to wash up, and destroy the evidence while we're at it...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Makes sense...==W== W-Wait, Alina?! Why are you taking off your armor...?",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_080"],["ctl","avg1_162","c","005",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","021","exclamation","lengzhan"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","c","006","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.3],["say","avg1_162","How else am I supposed to take a bath? Come on, hurry up.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","c","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",2.0],["say","avg1_162","A bath so fancy...==W== I only get to use it thanks to you.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","c","008",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm","m128"],["trn",0,1,true,true,0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,1,false,false,3.0],["say","avg1_162","The warmth of the steam,==W== the gentle scent of flowers…==W== So this is what it feels like to be healed.",11,""],["choice",["Alina, your back... Are you hurt?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_162","Hurt?==W== I don't think I...==W== Ah, do you mean my old wounds?",11,""],["say","avg1_162","If so, they don't hurt anymore,==W== so please don't worry.",11,""],["choice",["Old wounds? From when you were a gladiator?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_162","Yes.==W== But==W== I've always healed quickly,==W== so most injuries wouldn't even leave a mark if left alone…",11,""],["say","avg1_162","Those must have been especially deep,==W== which is why they remain.==W== That said, they'll fade little by little,==W== so there's no need for concern.",11,""],["choice",["So you're the type who doesn't scar easily too."],[[]]],["say","avg1_162","\"Too\"?==W== Could it be that Noya,==W== the one you say resembles me, is the same?",11,""],["say","avg1_162","… Honestly,==W== it's always Noya this, Noya that.==W== The one who faced hardship by your side==W== was not Noya, but me…",11,""],["say","avg1_162","To you,==W== I'm just someone to fill the loneliness of not being able to see her. A substitute, aren't I?",11,""],["choice",["No! That's not it."],[[]]],["choice",["I've never thought of you as someone else's replacement."],[[]]],["say","avg1_162","Hehe...==W== It's all right.",11,""],["say","avg1_162","If you see traces of her in me,==W== that only proves the memories you shared with her still remain in your heart.",11,""],["say","avg1_162","But I can't even remember the faces of the companions I once fought back-to-back with…==W== It's good you're not like me…",11,""],["choice",["Alina…"],[[]]],["say","avg1_162","I ...==W== treasured these old scars on my body==W== as offerings to the comrades who fell in the arena.",11,""],["say","avg1_162","And yet...==W== As the scars began to fade,==W== so too did the scenes of those days.",11,""],["say","avg1_162","To be honest,==W== I envy you.==W== You still have==W== someone you long to see.",11,""],["say","avg1_162","I no longer==W== have anyone like that anymore…",11,""],["choice",["You have me."],[[]]],["say","avg1_162","Hehe...==W== You really do==W== have a way with words.",11,""],["say","avg1_162","When I'm with you,==W== I just want to keep crossing the lines forever.==W== You really are ...==W== quite the handful.",11,""],["trn",0,1,false,false,1],["w",1],["bgm",""],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","sky_sunny",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,300.0,1.5,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,-300.0,null,"Linear",36.0,null,null,null],["se","se_036"],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["say","0","Alina quietly avoids the topic. She takes off the rest of her clothes and pulls me into the private bath meant just for the two of us.",0,""],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_sunlight_2",0,0],["say","0","I don't know what she's thinking, but as we sit in the water, she keeps her fingers laced with mine.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","Her fingers are slender, but her grip is steady and firm.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","Later on, Caligula's crimes are made public. But the story of that day remains a secret, one that's forever shared only between the two of us.",0,""],["show","avg1_162","a","008",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.5,null,"Linear",1.0],["film",0],["say","0","If only ... I could become your \"Noya.\"",3,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["se","se_036_stop"],["end"]]}